            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To wake up? (استيقظ, istayqaẓa.) To go up? (صعد, ṣaʿida.) To arrive? (وصل, waṣala.) To travel? (سافر, sāfara.) To cross? (عبر, ʿabara.) To taste? (ذاق, dhāqa.) To pour? (صب, ṣabba.) To switch off? (أطفأ, aṭfaʾa.) To fill? (ملأ, malaʾa.) To bathe? (استحم, istaḥamma.) To sneeze? (عطس, ʿaṭasa.) To breathe? (تنفس, tanaffasa.) To break? (كسر, kasara.) To rest? (استراح, istarāḥa.) To feel? (أحس, aḥassa.) To print? (طبع, ṭabaʿa.) To copy? (نسخ, nasakha.) To move? (انتقل, intaqala.) To register? (سجل, sajjala.) To employ? (وظف, waẓẓafa.)"
            }
